MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Media player: a track without a cover took the colours of the app's icon (a near-black icon made a black
player); now it gets the home widgets' glass (blurred wallpaper, see-through Monet card, edge, text and
buttons in the system palette) — BlueOSMediaGlass, ColorSchemeTransition.blueOSGlass. With a cover: as before.
Lock screen lines under the clock: «Как в Android» (as before) or «Как в «Сводке»» — the greeting semibold
with «Сэнсэй» in the clock's colour, the date row medium with the weather in that colour
(blueos_lock_greeting_style, blueos_lock_date_style). Arona or Plana on the lock screen (blueos_character).

